WEBVTT

00:00:02.980 --> 00:00:05.310
Run! Hurry it up!

00:00:05.310 --> 00:00:06.810
Tooru-chan's waiting for you!

00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:09.280
Coming...

00:00:11.150 --> 00:00:12.700
Did you forget anything?

00:00:13.610 --> 00:00:15.030
Of course not.

00:00:15.530 --> 00:00:16.740
Take care!

00:00:17.030 --> 00:00:19.660
Okay. See you tonight.

00:00:21.160 --> 00:00:23.000
Thanks for waiting.

00:00:23.750 --> 00:00:25.210
Good morning, Run-chan.

00:02:06.560 --> 00:02:08.940
Wow, really?

00:02:08.940 --> 00:02:12.610
Hm? I texted you about it after dinner yesterday.

00:02:12.610 --> 00:02:13.900
Huh? Really?

00:02:13.900 --> 00:02:16.030
I didn't see that text.

00:02:16.280 --> 00:02:16.820
Hm?

00:02:17.570 --> 00:02:18.360
Run-chan.

00:02:19.660 --> 00:02:20.740
Your socks.

00:02:23.120 --> 00:02:25.700
I forgot to put on one of them!

00:02:27.580 --> 00:02:29.670
This is so embarrassing...

00:02:31.710 --> 00:02:34.500
I might as well go barefoot then.

00:02:44.180 --> 00:02:46.520
R-R-R-R-Run-chan...

00:02:46.520 --> 00:02:48.390
W-Wh-Wh-Wh-Wh...

00:02:49.270 --> 00:02:50.440
Where are your panties?

00:02:57.360 --> 00:02:59.570
How on Earth did I not notice that!

00:02:59.570 --> 00:03:01.070
How on Earth...

00:03:01.070 --> 00:03:03.490
Don't squat! You'll be exposed in front!

00:03:04.530 --> 00:03:06.290
It was because I was sleepy...

00:03:06.290 --> 00:03:08.410
Is that the only reason?

00:03:08.410 --> 00:03:11.290
Am I the only one who does this?

00:03:12.080 --> 00:03:14.090
<i>Usually not their panties, though.</i>

00:03:14.590 --> 00:03:16.170
Tooru... just now...

00:03:16.960 --> 00:03:17.800
Just now...

00:03:18.670 --> 00:03:21.470
You thought, "Usually not panties," right?

00:03:30.390 --> 00:03:31.190
Not again...

00:03:31.730 --> 00:03:33.860
You sure have it rough, Tooru.

00:03:34.520 --> 00:03:36.440
Sorry about that, Tooru.

00:03:39.400 --> 00:03:42.780
I'm just not a morning person...

00:03:43.110 --> 00:03:45.660
I get so sleepy that I space out.

00:03:45.660 --> 00:03:47.030
Is that the issue here?

00:03:47.370 --> 00:03:49.040
She's wearing them now.

00:03:50.370 --> 00:03:52.120
O-Of course she is!

00:03:52.120 --> 00:03:55.420
I... I was just thinking, what if...

00:03:56.250 --> 00:03:57.550
Ah, oh yeah, Run.

00:03:57.550 --> 00:03:58.460
What?

00:03:59.010 --> 00:04:03.260
Can I copy your class notes from yesterday afternoon?

00:04:03.260 --> 00:04:04.010
Ah.

00:04:04.010 --> 00:04:06.640
That's right, you left early yesterday.

00:04:06.640 --> 00:04:07.390
Sure thing.

00:04:07.930 --> 00:04:08.470
Here.

00:04:09.310 --> 00:04:10.310
Thanks!

00:04:10.980 --> 00:04:12.350
You're a lifesaver.

00:04:17.020 --> 00:04:18.190
What language is this?

00:04:18.190 --> 00:04:20.900
Oh, come on, it's Japanese!

00:04:20.900 --> 00:04:23.320
I had a fit of sleepiness during class.

00:04:23.740 --> 00:04:25.320
So it's not just mornings then.

00:04:26.030 --> 00:04:27.660
Is it hard to read?

00:04:28.240 --> 00:04:30.290
N-No, not at all!

00:04:32.160 --> 00:04:33.210
Thank you!

00:04:33.210 --> 00:04:35.630
If there's any part you can't read, just say so.

00:04:39.960 --> 00:04:40.590
Here.

00:04:41.050 --> 00:04:42.470
Thanks!

00:04:42.470 --> 00:04:43.760
Hey, Yuuko-chan.

00:04:43.760 --> 00:04:45.800
Can you let me see that afterwards?

00:04:47.180 --> 00:04:48.050
Sure.

00:04:48.050 --> 00:04:49.970
When you're done copying, give it to Run.

00:04:50.560 --> 00:04:51.470
All right then.

00:04:52.640 --> 00:04:53.770
Right then.

00:04:53.770 --> 00:04:54.690
Hey.

00:04:54.690 --> 00:04:55.190
Hm?

00:04:55.520 --> 00:04:57.190
Nagi, are you nearsighted?

00:04:57.190 --> 00:04:58.690
What's your acuity?

00:04:59.820 --> 00:05:00.940
2.0

00:05:01.570 --> 00:05:03.490
These glasses are just for show.

00:05:03.490 --> 00:05:05.820
Really? Why do you wear fake glasses?

00:05:06.610 --> 00:05:08.120
If I don't wear these...

00:05:08.490 --> 00:05:11.850
I end up seeing things I don't have to see.

00:05:13.330 --> 00:05:15.920
You mean... don't tell me...

00:05:16.330 --> 00:05:17.080
Oh!

00:05:17.500 --> 00:05:19.920
Just now, right behind you, Yuuko...

00:05:22.050 --> 00:05:23.300
No, I'm kidding.

00:05:24.800 --> 00:05:26.220
I told you, I'm joking.

00:05:29.760 --> 00:05:31.810
It's too much fun to tease you.

00:05:32.140 --> 00:05:33.890
I'm just nearsighted.

00:05:33.890 --> 00:05:35.310
Seriously, stop it!

00:05:35.310 --> 00:05:37.310
I'm bad with scary stories!

00:05:37.810 --> 00:05:39.940
You scared me too!

00:05:39.940 --> 00:05:41.980
Nagi-chan, you're a good actor!

00:05:42.400 --> 00:05:44.690
You should join the drama club!

00:05:44.990 --> 00:05:46.030
I'm in it.

00:05:46.030 --> 00:05:46.280
Eh?

00:05:46.780 --> 00:05:48.070
I'm a phantom member, though.

00:05:49.160 --> 00:05:49.740
Clever!

00:05:49.740 --> 00:05:50.660
Not at all!

00:06:08.430 --> 00:06:10.050
<i>I need to go to the bathroom...</i>

00:06:12.560 --> 00:06:14.310
Um, sensei...

00:06:15.140 --> 00:06:15.850
What is it?

00:06:16.230 --> 00:06:18.560
Uhh... umm...

00:06:19.560 --> 00:06:23.270
<i>Oh no! I'm too embarrassed to say I have to go to the bathroom!</i>

00:06:23.980 --> 00:06:27.490
My... my head hurts...

00:06:27.490 --> 00:06:29.320
<i>Yuuko, that's your stomach!</i>

00:06:29.950 --> 00:06:32.450
Um, I mean, that is...

00:06:32.450 --> 00:06:34.160
Sensei, excuse me!

00:06:34.580 --> 00:06:36.200
I need to use the bathroom,

00:06:36.200 --> 00:06:40.040
so can I bring Yuuko to the nurse's office, and go along the way?

00:06:40.630 --> 00:06:41.830
Very well, you may go.

00:06:42.080 --> 00:06:43.040
Run...

00:06:43.040 --> 00:06:44.590
Let's go, Yuuko-chan!

00:06:45.300 --> 00:06:46.300
Right.

00:06:49.260 --> 00:06:52.550
S-Sorry about that, Run. You saved me back there.

00:06:52.970 --> 00:06:55.770
It's okay. I needed to go, too.

00:06:56.100 --> 00:06:57.810
Oh, to the bathroom, too?

00:06:58.310 --> 00:06:59.810
No, to the...

00:07:04.610 --> 00:07:05.860
...nurse's office.

00:07:06.820 --> 00:07:07.570
Run!

00:07:09.860 --> 00:07:11.240
Run, what's wrong?

00:07:12.160 --> 00:07:13.280
Does it hurt anywhere?

00:07:13.570 --> 00:07:16.700
I'm not sure what's wrong, but I don't feel so great...

00:07:16.700 --> 00:07:19.540
Maybe I caught something-

00:07:19.790 --> 00:07:20.870
I'm gonna be sick.

00:07:20.870 --> 00:07:22.120
Should we go to the bathroom?

00:07:22.120 --> 00:07:23.830
But wait, uh, to the nurse's office?

00:07:24.290 --> 00:07:25.540
No, to the bathroom?

00:07:25.840 --> 00:07:29.300
To the... to... to... to...

00:07:29.800 --> 00:07:30.800
That's right!

00:07:30.800 --> 00:07:32.180
Tooru!

00:07:32.180 --> 00:07:35.350
Yuuko-chan! That's not what I...

00:07:39.850 --> 00:07:41.520
Run! Hey!

00:07:41.850 --> 00:07:44.020
Run! Pull yourself together!

00:07:44.560 --> 00:07:45.310
Yuuko.

00:07:46.190 --> 00:07:46.820
You here?

00:07:47.480 --> 00:07:48.730
Tooru!

00:07:48.730 --> 00:07:50.860
Run suddenly lost consciousness!

00:07:51.320 --> 00:07:54.950
The nurse isn't here today, either. What do we do?

00:07:54.950 --> 00:07:55.740
Calm down!

00:07:55.740 --> 00:07:57.830
Why don't you call another teacher or something...

00:07:57.830 --> 00:07:59.830
Both of you, be quiet.

00:08:01.290 --> 00:08:02.750
There's nothing to worry about.

00:08:08.880 --> 00:08:11.010
She was just sleep-deprived.

00:08:33.530 --> 00:08:34.320
It's raining.

00:08:35.660 --> 00:08:36.740
No umbrella.

00:08:36.740 --> 00:08:39.990
Me neither. It was sunny this morning.

00:08:39.990 --> 00:08:42.620
But it's just showering. If we run, we can make it.

00:08:43.250 --> 00:08:44.830
Wait here, Tooru.

00:08:44.830 --> 00:08:46.170
Watch me!

00:08:51.460 --> 00:08:53.470
I discovered recently,

00:08:53.470 --> 00:08:55.550
that I'm a rain woman.

00:08:56.180 --> 00:08:57.800
You don't have to risk your life!

00:08:57.800 --> 00:08:58.850
Hurry up and get back here!

00:09:01.640 --> 00:09:03.390
I got all wet!

00:09:03.390 --> 00:09:04.940
Don't be so reckless.

00:09:12.990 --> 00:09:13.900
<i>Who's that?</i>

00:09:13.900 --> 00:09:15.450
<i>He's staring at us.</i>

00:09:16.200 --> 00:09:19.450
<i>With Run-chan in the state she's in now...</i>

00:09:20.120 --> 00:09:21.200
Run-chan.

00:09:21.200 --> 00:09:21.910
Hm?

00:09:21.910 --> 00:09:23.290
Let's go inside.

00:09:23.290 --> 00:09:24.120
Sure.

00:09:31.300 --> 00:09:32.130
Wonderful.

00:09:34.550 --> 00:09:37.430
Thank goodness. At this school...

00:09:42.520 --> 00:09:44.520
Run-chan, if you don't dry off quickly...

00:09:45.600 --> 00:09:47.520
Okay, it's done!

00:09:48.020 --> 00:09:49.770
Tooru, put this on!

00:09:51.480 --> 00:09:52.730
Ta-dah!

00:09:53.980 --> 00:09:55.990
Now you don't need an umbrella!

00:09:56.860 --> 00:09:59.490
At our age, isn't this a bit awkward?

00:10:00.030 --> 00:10:02.410
I mean, if we were elementary schoolers...

00:10:02.410 --> 00:10:04.250
Yeah, I guess it is.

00:10:04.250 --> 00:10:06.210
People might think we're a couple since we match.

00:10:06.660 --> 00:10:08.710
Then, one of us should...

00:10:08.710 --> 00:10:10.790
No, that's not what I meant.

00:10:12.630 --> 00:10:13.750
What is that?

00:10:14.260 --> 00:10:15.590
Then I'll take mine off.

00:10:15.590 --> 00:10:16.970
I'm already wet anyway.

00:10:16.970 --> 00:10:18.180
No, I'll do it.

00:10:19.300 --> 00:10:21.680
Nagi-chan, Yuuko-chan!

00:10:22.300 --> 00:10:24.350
Don't come after us!

00:10:26.520 --> 00:10:27.520
Good grief.

00:10:27.940 --> 00:10:30.150
I was wondering what you were doing.

00:10:30.560 --> 00:10:32.150
Run! You're soaked!

00:10:32.570 --> 00:10:33.860
My place isn't far.

00:10:33.860 --> 00:10:35.360
Want to dry your clothes there?

00:10:35.360 --> 00:10:37.570
Can I? Thanks!

00:10:37.570 --> 00:10:38.990
But it's still...

00:10:40.910 --> 00:10:42.320
Wow...

00:10:42.620 --> 00:10:44.950
Wonder if there's a rain woman on campus.

00:10:46.950 --> 00:10:48.710
Now what do we do?

00:10:49.120 --> 00:10:51.750
It's raining harder, but if we run, it'll be fine!

00:10:52.330 --> 00:10:55.500
If we all get wet, we won't be scared!

00:10:56.960 --> 00:10:59.300
Well, if it's just to Nagi's house...

00:10:59.300 --> 00:11:00.970
What a drag.

00:11:01.510 --> 00:11:03.890
I don't want to get wet, so I'll call a taxi.

00:11:04.350 --> 00:11:06.600
Such an un-high-schooler-like utterance!

00:11:09.690 --> 00:11:11.770
Maybe it'll stop if we wait?

00:11:11.770 --> 00:11:12.650
Doesn't look like it.

00:11:12.940 --> 00:11:14.520
I'm telling you, I'll call a taxi-

00:11:14.520 --> 00:11:15.650
Here I go!

00:11:15.860 --> 00:11:17.610
Nagi-chan, your house is this way, right?

00:11:17.610 --> 00:11:18.650
Hey, stop!

00:11:18.650 --> 00:11:20.070
Wait, me too!

00:11:21.280 --> 00:11:22.620
I said wait up!

00:11:22.620 --> 00:11:23.450
Come on, come on!

00:11:23.450 --> 00:11:24.660
Hang on!

00:11:24.660 --> 00:11:25.990
Don't leave me behind!

00:11:27.750 --> 00:11:30.210
You'd think rainy days would make them depressed,

00:11:30.210 --> 00:11:31.790
but they're having so much fun.

00:11:34.630 --> 00:11:35.790
Ah, to be young!

00:11:42.260 --> 00:11:43.970
It's coming to me!

00:11:43.970 --> 00:11:45.430
It's all coming to me!

00:11:56.480 --> 00:11:58.110
Pardon the intrusion!

00:11:58.530 --> 00:11:59.820
Go ahead, come in.

00:12:00.240 --> 00:12:02.490
Let's hurry up and get in the bath.

00:12:03.490 --> 00:12:05.490
Hm? Aniki's home already.

00:12:05.990 --> 00:12:08.120
Nagi, you have an older brother?

00:12:09.620 --> 00:12:10.790
Onii-chan!

00:12:11.160 --> 00:12:12.870
I've got friends over!

00:12:13.120 --> 00:12:15.500
So don't use the bathroom, 'kay?

00:12:16.000 --> 00:12:17.340
Nagi-chan,

00:12:17.590 --> 00:12:20.510
do you call your older brother "aniki,"

00:12:20.510 --> 00:12:22.130
or "onii-chan"?

00:12:23.340 --> 00:12:24.550
I call him "aniki"!

00:12:26.010 --> 00:12:27.140
Well then,

00:12:27.640 --> 00:12:30.390
only two people can enter the bath at once.

00:12:31.310 --> 00:12:33.100
Let's split into two groups.

00:12:33.520 --> 00:12:36.360
Ready, set, and shoot.

00:12:37.820 --> 00:12:40.150
Well, I'll go first with Run then.

00:12:40.150 --> 00:12:41.860
Enjoy!

00:12:41.860 --> 00:12:43.280
Why don't we get changed, then?

00:12:46.030 --> 00:12:47.200
There we go.

00:13:04.300 --> 00:13:05.430
<i>That's right!</i>

00:13:05.430 --> 00:13:06.930
<i>Come to think of it,</i>

00:13:07.470 --> 00:13:10.810
<i>I've never spoken with Tooru alone before!</i>

00:13:13.140 --> 00:13:15.140
<i>What should I do?</i>

00:13:15.140 --> 00:13:17.310
<i>This awkward silence is kinda...</i>

00:13:17.310 --> 00:13:18.810
<i>Kinda...</i>

00:13:21.690 --> 00:13:22.150
Yuuko.

00:13:22.150 --> 00:13:23.380
Y-Yes?

00:13:24.070 --> 00:13:25.610
Want to watch something?

00:13:26.200 --> 00:13:28.570
There are plenty of DVDs.

00:13:28.570 --> 00:13:30.030
Th-There sure are.

00:13:33.250 --> 00:13:35.960
"Scary but True Urban Legends,"

00:13:35.960 --> 00:13:37.670
or silence.

00:13:37.670 --> 00:13:38.710
Which do you prefer?

00:13:39.170 --> 00:13:40.710
<i>The ultimate decision!</i>

00:13:42.960 --> 00:13:44.880
Just leave your clothes there.

00:13:45.220 --> 00:13:47.130
Okay! Here, right?

00:13:47.590 --> 00:13:49.550
Let's hop right in, then.

00:13:50.550 --> 00:13:51.560
Whoa, who are you?

00:13:51.970 --> 00:13:52.470
Huh?

00:13:53.020 --> 00:13:54.180
It's me, Run.

00:13:57.100 --> 00:13:59.100
Well yeah, I know that.

00:13:59.900 --> 00:14:01.070
But man,

00:14:01.070 --> 00:14:02.690
just letting your bangs down

00:14:04.070 --> 00:14:05.650
sure changes how you look.

00:14:12.830 --> 00:14:13.450
Who are you?

00:14:14.330 --> 00:14:15.330
Your reaction...

00:14:16.040 --> 00:14:16.710
I have no words.

00:14:22.250 --> 00:14:24.760
Ah, it feels so nice!

00:14:24.760 --> 00:14:26.340
Makes you feel refreshed, doesn't it?

00:14:27.380 --> 00:14:30.090
But we'd better finish up quickly.

00:14:30.090 --> 00:14:31.470
You're right.

00:14:31.470 --> 00:14:34.560
We've got to switch with Tooru and Yuuko-chan.

00:14:35.220 --> 00:14:38.270
Those two are alone in my room right now.

00:14:38.980 --> 00:14:40.520
Will they be all right?

00:14:40.900 --> 00:14:42.400
They'll be fine!

00:14:42.900 --> 00:14:44.780
They get along so well!

00:14:45.400 --> 00:14:46.490
Well...

00:14:46.860 --> 00:14:49.240
Even so...

00:15:06.380 --> 00:15:07.380
<i>Oh no! Oh no!</i>

00:15:07.380 --> 00:15:09.260
<i>I can't keep this up!</i>

00:15:09.260 --> 00:15:10.220
<i>That's right!</i>

00:15:10.220 --> 00:15:12.590
<i>If I close my eyes, I won't be scared.</i>

00:15:23.190 --> 00:15:25.230
<i>I'm the one who wants to scream.</i>

00:15:26.610 --> 00:15:28.190
Sorry for the wait!

00:15:28.190 --> 00:15:30.240
Go ahead and use the bath- huh?

00:15:30.820 --> 00:15:31.910
Oy, Yuuko?

00:15:31.910 --> 00:15:33.160
The bath is free.

00:15:33.700 --> 00:15:34.910
Yuuko-chan!

00:15:36.200 --> 00:15:37.410
Yuuko-chan?

00:15:38.330 --> 00:15:39.500
Yuuko-chan!

00:15:40.210 --> 00:15:41.460
Yuuko-chan?!

00:15:41.460 --> 00:15:42.620
Yuuko-chan!

00:15:42.620 --> 00:15:45.170
Oh no, Yuuko-chan has...!

00:15:46.590 --> 00:15:47.920
Whew.

00:15:47.920 --> 00:15:49.800
That was really scary.

00:15:50.550 --> 00:15:52.220
We finally get to take a bath!

00:15:52.220 --> 00:15:53.220
Right, Tooru?

00:15:53.720 --> 00:15:54.180
Yeah.

00:15:56.890 --> 00:15:58.180
Shall we get in?

00:16:05.480 --> 00:16:06.610
Say,

00:16:06.610 --> 00:16:09.650
Tooru, do you ever get scared while washing your hair,

00:16:09.650 --> 00:16:11.570
because you can't see?

00:16:15.530 --> 00:16:16.830
You see,

00:16:16.830 --> 00:16:20.000
when I was a kid, I was really bad with shampoo...

00:16:25.330 --> 00:16:27.130
Shampoo's getting in my eye!

00:16:27.500 --> 00:16:29.880
What are you doing, Tooru?

00:16:29.880 --> 00:16:31.550
Where's the shower head?

00:16:32.590 --> 00:16:34.970
My eyes...

00:16:37.350 --> 00:16:38.180
Hey!

00:16:38.180 --> 00:16:38.970
Yuuko!

00:16:39.430 --> 00:16:40.680
You're being too loud!

00:16:41.060 --> 00:16:43.020
Please, stop it!

00:16:45.100 --> 00:16:45.810
Gosh.

00:16:46.440 --> 00:16:48.860
I thought my heart would stop.

00:17:02.000 --> 00:17:04.460
My mind is going hazy.

00:17:05.000 --> 00:17:05.830
Run.

00:17:06.460 --> 00:17:07.500
Look at that.

00:17:08.040 --> 00:17:09.880
I can see an oasis.

00:17:10.550 --> 00:17:12.550
Nagi? Run?

00:17:14.050 --> 00:17:16.090
W-What happened to you two?

00:17:16.390 --> 00:17:17.430
Yuuko...

00:17:18.100 --> 00:17:21.560
How was the temperature of the bath?

00:17:21.560 --> 00:17:22.770
Never mind that!

00:17:24.060 --> 00:17:26.520
More importantly, shut off the heater already.

00:17:27.100 --> 00:17:29.900
We figured... we'd dry out our clothes...

00:17:33.650 --> 00:17:35.450
Delicious!

00:17:35.450 --> 00:17:37.320
Ah, I'm alive again!

00:17:37.320 --> 00:17:39.490
Gosh, don't worry us like that!

00:17:41.200 --> 00:17:42.830
They're pretty much dry.

00:17:43.160 --> 00:17:45.500
I wonder if the rain will stop soon?

00:17:46.790 --> 00:17:48.250
Not yet, it looks like.

00:17:49.130 --> 00:17:50.540
It sure is coming down.

00:17:51.170 --> 00:17:53.300
Rainy days really get to your hair.

00:17:53.880 --> 00:17:56.760
Mine sort of goes all limp.

00:17:57.090 --> 00:17:59.930
Mine gets all spread out and won't stay down.

00:18:00.470 --> 00:18:02.680
I guess we have different hair types.

00:18:03.890 --> 00:18:06.230
Yuuko-chan, let me touch your hair!

00:18:06.230 --> 00:18:07.480
Sure, go ahead.

00:18:09.770 --> 00:18:12.110
Yuuko-chan, your hair is so pretty!

00:18:12.110 --> 00:18:12.610
Hm?

00:18:13.440 --> 00:18:15.320
You don't have any split ends!

00:18:15.610 --> 00:18:18.070
Aw, that's not true.

00:18:38.090 --> 00:18:39.840
Hey, isn't this outfit cute-

00:18:39.840 --> 00:18:41.220
Don't move!

00:18:41.220 --> 00:18:43.310
This is the delicate part!

00:18:45.140 --> 00:18:46.060
All right.

00:18:46.390 --> 00:18:47.520
There we go!

00:18:51.440 --> 00:18:52.810
W-What?

00:18:53.150 --> 00:18:54.320
Don't move!

00:19:00.410 --> 00:19:02.120
I lost!

00:19:03.530 --> 00:19:05.200
You're still playing?

00:19:05.200 --> 00:19:07.080
I'm going to beat Nagi's high score.

00:19:07.830 --> 00:19:09.710
That's quite the temperament you've got.

00:19:14.250 --> 00:19:16.710
Yuuko, your hands are kinda pretty.

00:19:17.210 --> 00:19:19.340
T-They aren't really...

00:19:19.340 --> 00:19:20.800
How do you take care of them?

00:19:21.390 --> 00:19:23.180
I don't do anything in particular.

00:19:23.430 --> 00:19:25.560
Well then, in that case...

00:19:26.600 --> 00:19:27.810
Ba-ba-bum!

00:19:32.650 --> 00:19:34.650
It feels nice,

00:19:34.650 --> 00:19:36.480
b-but it's kinda embarrassing.

00:19:40.700 --> 00:19:42.610
T-Tooru? Ah, wait-

00:19:44.410 --> 00:19:45.410
Don't move!

00:19:47.490 --> 00:19:51.000
Gosh! What am I supposed to do then?

00:21:19.840 --> 00:21:20.710
Well,

00:21:20.710 --> 00:21:22.840
it's certainly not bad.

00:21:24.760 --> 00:21:25.720
But...

00:21:25.720 --> 00:21:28.010
it sorta sounds like something's grilling.

00:21:28.430 --> 00:21:31.350
It's making me kind of hungry.

00:21:32.060 --> 00:21:32.930
Run-chan.

00:21:36.600 --> 00:21:37.730
That was me.

00:21:37.730 --> 00:21:38.610
Again?

00:21:40.540 --> 00:21:41.150
See you.

00:21:41.580 --> 00:21:43.440
Be careful on your way home.

00:21:43.440 --> 00:21:44.490
Will do!

00:21:44.860 --> 00:21:46.400
Thanks for lending us umbrellas, too!

00:21:46.700 --> 00:21:48.570
See you tomorrow, then!

00:21:49.070 --> 00:21:50.620
Thanks for letting us stop by!

00:21:52.120 --> 00:21:53.290
See you!

00:21:55.750 --> 00:21:58.250
Hey, that umbrella's pretty cute!

00:21:58.250 --> 00:21:59.460
It sure is.

00:21:59.460 --> 00:22:01.500
Ah, the rain's still coming down strong.

00:22:01.500 --> 00:22:04.170
What time's the next train?

00:22:05.880 --> 00:22:07.340
Onii-chan!

00:22:07.340 --> 00:22:09.680
You can use the bathroom again now!

00:22:18.980 --> 00:22:20.230
Didn't I tell you

00:22:21.230 --> 00:22:22.360
to be careful?

00:22:22.980 --> 00:22:24.030
I'm sorry.

00:23:57.700 --> 00:23:59.450
Everyone, sorry for the wait!

00:23:59.450 --> 00:24:02.330
Next week, Yutaka and Miporin are finally appearing!

00:24:02.330 --> 00:24:03.670
Sorry for the wait!

00:24:03.670 --> 00:24:05.420
Thinking back, it was fifteen years of determination...

00:24:05.420 --> 00:24:07.670
Right! Enough nostalgia!

00:24:07.670 --> 00:24:11.010
So wait, meaning we weren't supposed to show up in episode one?

00:24:11.010 --> 00:24:14.180
Well, if you put it that way, we did show up in the opening.

00:24:14.180 --> 00:24:15.930
Well, I guess you're right.

00:24:15.930 --> 00:24:17.100
Next time on A-Channel!

00:24:17.310 --> 00:24:18.720
"Classmates"!

00:24:18.720 --> 00:24:20.680
Ah, but of course, aside from us classmates,

00:24:20.680 --> 00:24:23.480
the upperclassmen will show up as well!
